{
  "name": "09-core-loop-no-rules",
  "description": "The core loop in a workspace with no rules: the owner adds a task with two build criteria and completes its contract, a builder seat the app runs claims it, acknowledges, starts and passes each criterion with evidence and submits; a reviewer seat on another login fails the review naming the second criterion; the builder, free, gets a fresh lease, acknowledges, reworks the criterion and submits again; the same reviewer passes it and the task is Done.",
  "covers": [
    "PRD Build order, Core loop: the two seats finish a task end to end, including one failed review, with no rules (milestone 2 plan TS-8, inventory-engine section 10).",
    "PRD Task lifecycle: Add task, Complete contract, Claim, Acknowledge briefing, Start criterion, Pass criterion, Submit, Claim review, Acknowledge review briefing, Review fails, Review passes with no outward action.",
    "Milestone 2 plan EN-5 and SC-11: with no rules no hook writes a check event, and no No reviewer is eligible item opens.",
    "Milestone 2 plan EN-7: a claim records its credential and model; a seat whose model is empty (the tool's default) records model null.",
    "Milestone 2 plan EN-9, EN-10, EN-12: review.failed reopens the named criterion only; during rework criterion.started and criterion.passed open no step; each verdict writes cost.reported with the review as subject.",
    "PRD Steps and timing: wait_contract, wait_ready, briefing, build, finish, wait_review, review, wait_builder and rework touch end to end and sum to the task's lifetime."
  ],
